      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_8",
      "quote": "The inclusion criteria of the included studies were having COVID-19-infected patients aged 18 or older being treated with remdesivir and/or placebo. ... We included studies if they were randomized control trials, they had an intervention arm as compared to placebo, and the end point of interest was clinical outcomes and mortality.",
