      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_13",
      "quote": "Consequently, 704 records were excluded due to ineligibility (reviews, editorials, non-random controlled trials, ongoing trials, and abstracts).",
      "reason": "The review specifies some report characteristics (e.g., excluding reviews, editorials, ongoing trials, and abstracts), but fails to specify restrictions regarding language or publication year."
