      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_11",
      "quote": "If more than one study reported data on posttreatment outcomes, data were extracted separately for each study. ... We calculated the ORs and 95% confidence intervals (CIs) for each measure evaluated in two or more studies.",
      "reason": "The review specifies that data were extracted and synthesized for each outcome measure (e.g., mortality, oxygen support, adverse events) evaluated in two or more studies, linking the synthesis groups to the review objectives."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "MISSING",
